{"version":1,"content":"<p>【香港首例 😱】香港終於出現 iPhone Duo 爆屏幕分享首例。</p><p>社交平台 Threads 用戶 terrylau130 分享了他的爆屏幕經歷，新機僅正常使用半天，內屏幕即因鉸鏈處出現異常異物，令開合阻力感覺明顯不同，然後「啪」的一聲就爆了。</p><p>不過 Apple 香港的處理動作亦相當迅速，當判定屬非人為瑕疵後，隨即為其更換全新手機，這一點絕對值得稱讚。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:30.972473+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T13:46:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:05.256737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.538238+00:00","content_hash":"fcf1e1b9c13dac7101277f02f6a5b46ec80b09ee02028dd9b2c57e1dc6053851","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}